          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Maryam+Mirzakhani"}> Maryam Mirzakhani
            , 2014
          %ul
            %li
              The dynamics and geometry of Riemann surfaces and their moduli spaces, including a new proof of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Witten+conjecture"} Witten conjecture
          %p
            In (
            %a{:href => "Mumford+conjecture#Madsen07"}> Madsen 07
